WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.660
Place value is a row of seats.

00:00:02.660 --> 00:00:05.790
Each seat is worth ten times the seat on its right.

00:00:05.790 --> 00:00:08.570
The decimal point never moves.

00:00:08.570 --> 00:00:11.420
Multiply three point four five by ten:

00:00:11.420 --> 00:00:14.000
every digit moves one seat left.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:16.030
Thirty-four point five.

00:00:16.030 --> 00:00:19.130
Now divide three point four five by ten:

00:00:19.130 --> 00:00:21.740
every digit moves one seat right,

00:00:21.740 --> 00:00:24.600
and a zero fills the empty ones seat.

00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:27.200
Zero point three four five.

